  - "Ch\xE1u l\xE0 Leaf \u0111\xE2y \u1EA1! Ch\xFA \u01A1i, d\u01B0\u1EDBi ng\u1EE5c t\u1ED1i s\xE2u ho\u1EAFm c\xF3 qu\xE1i v\u1EADt h\xECnh c\xE2y n\u1EA5m bi\u1EBFt nh\u1EA3y m\xFAa th\u1EADt kh\xF4ng ch\xFA?"
  - "M\xF3n th\u1EA1ch Slime d\u1EBBo ch\xFA l\xE0m ng\u1ECDt l\u1ECBm nh\u01B0 k\u1EB9o \u1EA5y, ch\xE1u th\xEDch m\xEA lu\xF4n! Khi n\xE0o qu\xE1n m\u1EDF c\u1EEDa l\u1EA1i nh\u1EDB ph\u1EA7n ch\xE1u m\u1ED9t \u0111\u0129a to nh\xE9!"
  interactRange: 2.2
